<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:33,780 --> 00:01:35,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If there's an instance where we
get separated,</font>

39
00:01:36,490 --> 00:01:38,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">don't trust anyone even if they
look like your teammate.</font>

40
00:01:39,740 --> 00:01:41,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like now, there's a possibility</font>

41
00:01:41,950 --> 00:01:43,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that an enemy will transform
themselves to get close to us!</font>

42
00:01:43,910 --> 00:01:44,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

43
00:01:44,660 --> 00:01:46,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what do we do?</font>

44
00:01:47,290 --> 00:01:48,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll decide on a password.</font>

45
00:01:49,420 --> 00:01:51,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Password?</font>

46
00:01:52,380 --> 00:01:55,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll only say it once so listen closely.</font>

47
00:01:56,510 --> 00:01:57,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You ask Ninja song, "Ninja Chance".</font>

48
00:01:58,300 --> 00:02:00,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the answer is this:</font>

49
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:03,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"It is a chance to sneak up where a large
number of enemies are making a scene.</font>

50
00:02:04,100 --> 00:02:06,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"The quiet place has
no secret hideout.</font>

51
00:02:07,730 --> 00:02:10,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"It is important for
a Shinobi to know the right time.</font>

52
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:13,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"The time when an enemy
is tired and drops his guard.".</font>

53
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:14,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's all.</font>

54
00:02:16,110 --> 00:02:17,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Huge!</font>

55
00:02:21,910 --> 00:02:22,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-Tail!</font>

56
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:32,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You want our Earth Scroll, don't you?</font>

57
00:02:45,770 --> 00:02:48,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, let's begin...</font>

58
00:02:50,850 --> 00:02:53,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the battle for the Scrolls.</font>

59
00:02:56,070 --> 00:02:57,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Life or death!</font>

60
00:03:06,870 --> 00:03:09,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If this creature doesn't want
to spit me out ...</font>

61
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:13,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make it do so at any cost!</font>

62
00:03:15,340 --> 00:03:17,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

63
00:03:24,430 --> 00:03:25,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't move!</font>

64
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:32,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted you to entertain me more.</font>

65
00:03:33,940 --> 00:03:35,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too bad.</font>

66
00:03:40,650 --> 00:03:41,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Move!</font>

67
00:03:47,870 --> 00:03:50,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He nullified his fear with pain.</font>

68
00:03:53,250 --> 00:03:56,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As expected,
he's not your average prey.</font>

69
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:07,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't come near me!</font>

70
00:04:14,770 --> 00:04:17,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't lower your guard,
not even for a moment...</font>

71
00:04:27,990 --> 00:04:33,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Prey must always be tense
and flee in desperation</font>

72
00:04:35,210 --> 00:04:37,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">before a predator!</font>

73
00:04:49,100 --> 00:04:50,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, Sasuke.</font>

74
00:04:58,270 --> 00:04:59,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

75
00:05:01,900 --> 00:05:05,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The password... I forgot it!</font>

76
00:05:06,570 --> 00:05:12,080
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Naruto Strikes Back!</font>

77
00:05:06,570 --> 00:05:12,080
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">I'm Not Going</font>

78
00:05:06,570 --> 00:05:12,080
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">to Run Away!</font>

79
00:05:18,670 --> 00:05:22,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The password... I forgot it!</font>

80
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:24,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's all right, Naruto!</font>

81
00:05:25,220 --> 00:05:26,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're doing great!</font>

82
00:05:29,890 --> 00:05:30,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

83
00:05:31,060 --> 00:05:33,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know you're trying to be cool and
rescue us, but...</font>

84
00:05:33,390 --> 00:05:34,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get involved!</font>

85
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:35,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just run!</font>

86
00:05:36,350 --> 00:05:38,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's...
She's on a much different level!</font>

87
00:05:38,860 --> 00:05:43,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seems like you brought that
giant snake down brilliantly, Naruto-kun.</font>

88
00:05:44,900 --> 00:05:49,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how you look,
she looks like a snake...</font>

89
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:58,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it, it was all the handiwork
of this woman.</font>

90
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:08,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Him showing up to help has never
helped any situation...</font>

91
00:06:09,930 --> 00:06:11,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what should I do...?</font>

92
00:06:11,470 --> 00:06:17,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, hey! Evidently you've been
bullying the weakling!</font>

93
00:06:17,770 --> 00:06:20,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that I, Uzumaki Naruto-sama is here,</font>

94
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:22,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to wipe the floor with you!</font>

95
00:06:22,570 --> 00:06:26,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! If things continue like this,
all three of us are done for!</font>

96
00:06:28,320 --> 00:06:29,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should I do?</font>

97
00:06:36,330 --> 00:06:37,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

98
00:06:46,050 --> 00:06:47,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no good.</font>

99
00:06:49,010 --> 00:06:50,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the only way.</font>

100
00:06:54,850 --> 00:06:56,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Wait.
— Hmm?</font>

101
00:06:56,850 --> 00:06:58,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?!
— Huh?</font>

102
00:07:05,190 --> 00:07:07,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's the scroll you want,
I'll give it to you.</font>

103
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm asking you.
Just take this and go.</font>

104
00:07:11,860 --> 00:07:13,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

105
00:07:13,660 --> 00:07:14,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

106
00:07:16,990 --> 00:07:19,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Sasuke!
What are you doing?</font>

107
00:07:19,910 --> 00:07:22,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you giving
our scroll to the enemy?</font>

108
00:07:22,830 --> 00:07:24,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, shut up!</font>

109
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:25,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

110
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:30,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...
You're sensible.</font>

111
00:07:32,890 --> 00:07:35,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only thing the "prey" can
hope for from the "predator" is</font>

112
00:07:36,060 --> 00:07:41,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">presenting other food in hopes
of being spared, isn't it?</font>

113
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take it.</font>

114
00:07:52,740 --> 00:07:53,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

115
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:03,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You! Don't interfere!</font>

116
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:05,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you understand this situation?!</font>

117
00:08:14,930 --> 00:08:17,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing all of a sudden?!</font>

118
00:08:30,900 --> 00:08:34,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for me,
I don't remember the password...</font>

119
00:08:35,030 --> 00:08:37,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I've got no way to make sure.</font>

120
00:08:38,370 --> 00:08:41,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you, you're a fake
Sasuke, aren't you?</font>

121
00:08:41,500 --> 00:08:42,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

122
00:08:42,540 --> 00:08:45,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What are you trying to start?!</font>

123
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:49,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot!
I'm the real me!</font>

124
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:53,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Liar.</font>

125
00:08:55,050 --> 00:09:00,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This, this stupid coward is... absolutely...</font>

126
00:09:00,930 --> 00:09:05,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not the Sasuke I know!</font>

127
00:09:05,060 --> 00:09:07,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know how strong she is but,</font>

128
00:09:07,730 --> 00:09:12,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">how can you be sure that she'll let us
go if we hand over the Scroll, huh?!</font>

129
00:09:14,700 --> 00:09:19,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the one who's choked and
doesn't understand the situation!</font>

130
00:09:22,370 --> 00:09:23,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun.</font>

131
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's correct.</font>

132
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:33,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Scroll.</font>

133
00:09:36,590 --> 00:09:39,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I could just kill you
and seize it.</font>

134
00:09:44,390 --> 00:09:45,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't mess with me!</font>

135
00:09:45,940 --> 00:09:47,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Run, Naruto! Stop it!</font>

136
00:09:48,150 --> 00:09:49,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

137
00:09:50,560 --> 00:09:52,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've lost confidence in you, Sasuke!</font>

138
00:09:53,070 --> 00:09:54,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

139
00:10:06,580 --> 00:10:07,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

140
00:10:21,890 --> 00:10:23,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are three corpses.</font>

141
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:27,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is some kind of Ninja Art,
isn't it...?</font>

142
00:10:28,770 --> 00:10:31,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad.</font>

143
00:10:35,070 --> 00:10:37,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have a problem,
right from the start.</font>

144
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:39,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be damned.</font>

145
00:10:45,540 --> 00:10:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inform Anko-san,
the Proctor of the second exam.</font>

146
00:10:48,580 --> 00:10:49,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir!</font>

147
00:10:54,670 --> 00:10:58,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're going to have dumplings,
you've got to have sweet red bean soup.</font>

148
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:05,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay...
Once I've eaten this,</font>

149
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:09,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should speed through and
go wait at the tower for the kids.</font>

150
00:11:10,770 --> 00:11:15,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this program, the quick kids
should clear it soon.</font>

151
00:11:17,190 --> 00:11:19,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf Village mark, perfect!</font>

152
00:11:24,780 --> 00:11:26,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have a problem, Anko-sama!</font>

153
00:11:27,410 --> 00:11:29,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What, so soon?</font>

154
00:11:30,410 --> 00:11:31,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Corpses! Three of them!</font>

155
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:36,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Furthermore, they're strange.</font>

156
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:38,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, please come!</font>

157
00:11:41,470 --> 00:11:42,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Strange?</font>

158
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:53,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I checked their possessions
and identification,</font>

159
00:11:53,900 --> 00:11:58,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shinobi from Grass Village
registered in the Chunin Exams, but...</font>

160
00:11:59,740 --> 00:12:00,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you can see...</font>

161
00:12:04,030 --> 00:12:05,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They have no faces.</font>

162
00:12:07,990 --> 00:12:08,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

163
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:13,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're smooth and flat,
like they've melted away.</font>

164
00:12:18,130 --> 00:12:19,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Without a doubt...</font>

165
00:12:20,460 --> 00:12:21,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Jutsu is...</font>

166
00:12:24,430 --> 00:12:25,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that man's...</font>

167
00:12:27,220 --> 00:12:29,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is he here at the exam?</font>

168
00:12:53,580 --> 00:12:56,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Show me the ID photos of
the three Grass Village Shinobi.</font>

169
00:12:56,670 --> 00:12:57,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was on their applications.</font>

170
00:12:57,920 --> 00:12:59,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

171
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:03,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this one's face was stolen.</font>

172
00:13:06,260 --> 00:13:08,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, back then, they were already...</font>

173
00:13:10,470 --> 00:13:12,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll return... the Kunai knife.</font>

174
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:15,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you for your trouble.</font>

175
00:13:19,940 --> 00:13:21,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're in big trouble.</font>

176
00:13:21,570 --> 00:13:22,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

177
00:13:22,740 --> 00:13:25,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You! Let Hokage-sama
know right away!</font>

178
00:13:26,700 --> 00:13:29,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Make a request to
the ANBU Black Ops</font>

179
00:13:29,160 --> 00:13:31,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to dispatch two or more squads
to the Forest of Death!</font>

180
00:13:31,790 --> 00:13:34,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Starting now,
I'm going to follow these guys!</font>

181
00:13:34,290 --> 00:13:35,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Got it?
— Yes!</font>

182
00:13:40,460 --> 00:13:41,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That man...</font>

183
00:13:41,880 --> 00:13:44,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That man... has come to the Leaf Village!</font>

184
00:13:58,810 --> 00:13:59,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So cute.</font>

185
00:14:00,770 --> 00:14:02,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're such cute prey.</font>

186
00:14:08,410 --> 00:14:09,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

187
00:14:09,660 --> 00:14:10,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

188
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:22,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the time being, eat him.</font>

189
00:14:39,270 --> 00:14:40,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shove it!</font>

190
00:14:52,160 --> 00:14:54,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This brat! He can't be...</font>

191
00:15:03,500 --> 00:15:05,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto's lost control...</font>

192
00:15:06,260 --> 00:15:10,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...
how is he so strong?!</font>

193
00:15:31,740 --> 00:15:32,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those eyes...</font>

194
00:15:32,870 --> 00:15:34,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no mistake.</font>

195
00:15:35,410 --> 00:15:38,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's... Naruto?!</font>

196
00:15:39,870 --> 00:15:41,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This just got interesting.</font>

197
00:15:43,080 --> 00:15:43,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next up is...</font>

198
00:15:46,710 --> 00:15:47,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun.</font>

199
00:15:48,170 --> 00:15:49,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what's your move?!</font>

200
00:15:57,260 --> 00:15:58,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

201
00:16:10,110 --> 00:16:11,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to hurry.</font>

202
00:16:13,570 --> 00:16:14,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a...</font>

203
00:16:16,410 --> 00:16:17,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">bad hunch about this.</font>

204
00:16:36,970 --> 00:16:40,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey. Are you hurt?</font>

205
00:16:46,230 --> 00:16:47,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Scaredy cat?!</font>

206
00:16:56,780 --> 00:16:57,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

207
00:16:59,870 --> 00:17:00,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

208
00:17:01,870 --> 00:17:03,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you hurt...</font>

209
00:17:05,120 --> 00:17:06,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Scaredy cat?</font>

210
00:17:10,460 --> 00:17:11,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

211
00:17:16,300 --> 00:17:22,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This stupid coward is absolutely
not the Sasuke I know!</font>

212
00:17:29,690 --> 00:17:30,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

213
00:17:31,940 --> 00:17:35,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!
Let me go!</font>

214
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:37,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You stupid snake!</font>

215
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:44,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think that the
nine-tailed brat survived...</font>

216
00:17:48,580 --> 00:17:53,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When you get excited, a bit
of the nine-tail's power trickles out...</font>

217
00:17:58,890 --> 00:18:01,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've grown up in an interesting way.</font>

218
00:18:04,770 --> 00:18:05,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look...</font>

219
00:18:05,930 --> 00:18:08,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Seal is appearing on
your skin like a tattoo.</font>

220
00:18:12,730 --> 00:18:15,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Five-Pronged... Sealing!</font>

221
00:18:27,160 --> 00:18:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun! Help Naruto!</font>

222
00:18:39,970 --> 00:18:41,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Twelve years since the seal...</font>

223
00:18:42,220 --> 00:18:47,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun's Chakra and the nine-tail's
Chakra are beginning to act in sync...</font>

224
00:18:52,730 --> 00:18:56,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But now... you're in the way.</font>

225
00:19:01,990 --> 00:19:03,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's gonna fall!</font>

226
00:19:04,410 --> 00:19:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

227
00:19:09,040 --> 00:19:10,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened, Sasuke-kun?!</font>

228
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:16,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

229
00:19:22,800 --> 00:19:26,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto's certainly different
from you, Sasuke-kun.</font>

230
00:19:26,390 --> 00:19:29,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a klutz and
kind of gets in the way.</font>

231
00:19:29,430 --> 00:19:32,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But he's not in the least a coward!</font>

232
00:19:32,940 --> 00:19:34,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right?
Isn't that right?</font>

233
00:19:42,570 --> 00:19:44,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Foolish younger brother.</font>

234
00:19:45,490 --> 00:19:50,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want to kill me,
resent me, hate me and...</font>

235
00:19:50,870 --> 00:19:54,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">continue to live your ugly life.</font>

236
00:19:55,170 --> 00:19:55,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Flee.</font>

237
00:19:55,960 --> 00:20:00,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Flee and cling to your life.</font>

238
00:20:03,090 --> 00:20:04,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

239
00:20:13,060 --> 00:20:18,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As expected of the Uchiha clan...
his blood has begun to stir...</font>

240
00:20:22,610 --> 00:20:23,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

241
00:20:27,580 --> 00:20:31,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should take my time and
confirm his true power.</font>

242
00:21:04,990 --> 00:21:09,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

