00:22:21,270 --> 00:22:27,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">harmonia, feel the telepathy</font></b></font></font>

270
00:22:27,990 --> 00:22:33,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font></font>

271
00:22:27,990 --> 00:22:33,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

272
00:22:37,540 --> 00:22:38,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'm an avenger.</font>

273
00:22:39,540 --> 00:22:42,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">In order to defeat my brother,
I have to survive today!</font>

274
00:22:43,630 --> 00:22:47,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But how can someone who won't risk
his life in a situation like this</font>

275
00:22:47,300 --> 00:22:49,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">be able to defeat my brother?</font>

276
00:22:50,340 --> 00:22:52,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Calm down, you should be able to see.</font>

277
00:22:52,550 --> 00:22:54,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">There should be some way
to intercept her movements.</font>

278
00:22:56,390 --> 00:23:00,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next episode:
"Revive, Sharginan! Finish Move - Fire Element, Dragon Fire Technique!"</font>

